<title>LATVIA: DEPOSITORY STOPS LATGALE FINANCE FIRM WORK.</title>
<headline>DEPOSITORY STOPS LATGALE FINANCE FIRM WORK.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central securities depository said on Monday that it has blocked the work of the Latgale finance and investment company.</p>
<p>The depository said in a statement that it halted the work of the company as it had not extended its securities broker licence, which ended on August 1.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
